  m_MaskingSettings:
    m_MaskingEnabled: 0
    m_UnmaskedViews: []
    MaskPreset: {fileID: 0}
  Text:
    m_Untranslated: "Your bouncy ball's bounce is probably pretty disappointing. It behaves more like a bag of sand than a lively, bouncy ball. \n\nTo make it bounce, you'll create and apply a Physics Material. Unlike standard materials, which control the visual aspects of GameObjects, <b>Physics Materials</b> govern the physical behavior of GameObjects, like how they bounce upon impact. "
